#: data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc:246
msgctxt "Route118_Text_StevenQuestions"
msgid ""
"STEVEN: Hi, {PLAYER}{KUN}!\p"
"It's me, STEVEN!\n"
"We met in the cave near DEWFORD.\p"
"Have you met many kinds of POKéMON\n"
"since I last saw you?\p"
"There are many, many kinds of POKéMON\n"
"in this wide world of ours.\p"
"If you wanted to raise only your\n"
"favorites, that's fine.\p"
"Perhaps you find it more fun to raise\n"
"all sorts of POKéMON.\p"
"As a TRAINER of POKéMON,\n"
"what do you think?\p"
"Of course, it's not any of my business.\p"
"It would be nice if we were to meet\n"
"again somewhere.$"
msgstr ""
"大吾：嗨，{PLAYER}{KUN}！\p"
"是我，大吾！\n"
"我们在武斗镇附近的洞窟里见过面。\p"
"自从上次见面以后，\n"
"你遇到了很多种宝可梦吗？\p"
"在我们这个广阔的世界里，\n"
"有许许多多种宝可梦。\p"
"如果你只想培养自己喜欢的宝可梦，\n"
"那也没关系。\p"
"也许培养各种各样的\n"
"宝可梦会让你觉得更有乐趣。\p"
"作为宝可梦训练家，你是怎么想的呢？\p"
"当然，这不关我的事。\p"
"希望我们还能在什么地方再见面。$"

#: data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc:264
msgctxt "Route118_Text_YouAgreeGoodRodIsGood"
msgid ""
"Hmm!\n"
"A GOOD ROD is really good!\p"
"Wouldn't you agree?$"
msgstr ""
"嗯！好钓竿真的很好！\p"
"你也这么觉得吧？$"

#: data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc:269
msgctxt "Route118_Text_IdenticalMindsTakeThis"
msgid ""
"Hmm!\n"
"We're of identical minds!\p"
"Hmm!\n"
"Take this GOOD ROD!$"
msgstr ""
"嗯！我们真是想到一块儿去了！\p"
"嗯！这把好钓竿送给你！$"

#: data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc:275
msgctxt "Route118_Text_TryYourLuckFishing"
msgid ""
"Wherever there's water, try your luck\n"
"at fishing.$"
msgstr ""
"只要有水的地方，\n"
"都可以试试钓鱼的运气。$"

#: data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc:279
msgctxt "Route118_Text_DontYouLikeToFish"
msgid "Don't you like to fish?$"
msgstr "你不喜欢钓鱼吗？$"

#: data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc:282
msgctxt "Route118_Text_TryCatchingMonWithGoodRod"
msgid ""
"Try catching all sorts of POKéMON\n"
"with your GOOD ROD.$"
msgstr "用你的好钓竿去钓各种各样的宝可梦吧。$"

#: data/maps/Route118/scripts.inc:286
msgctxt "Route118_Text_CanCrossRiversWithSurf"
msgid ""
"Even if there isn't a boat, you can\n"
"cross rivers and the sea if you have\l"
"a POKéMON that knows SURF.\p"
"POKéMON can be counted on to do so\n"
"much!$"
msgstr ""
"就算没有船，只要有会冲浪的宝可梦，\n"
"就能渡过河流和大海。\p"
"宝可梦真是能帮上很多忙呢！$"

